sociation":"MEMBER","original_position":1,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3814966638","pull_request_review_id":4974521345,"id":3814966638,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7jY8Vu","diff_hunk":"@@ -1569,37 +1593,39 @@ void Image::shrink_x2() {\n }\n \n void Image::normalize() {","path":"core/image.cpp","commit_id":"a924a9b93d5dbf8aef606d7c050a85a131f97320","original_commit_id":"6e6e14cbcf62d4a840ae38d16c051002f2ba5723","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This might need a lock because `clear_mipmaps` and `generate_mipmaps` both have one. If you don't lock here the methods could fail and the function could exit with incorrect state.\nThis used to be broken before too but isn't any worse like this, so maybe out of scope?","created_at":"2026-08-19T16:45:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T16:48:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3814966638","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3814966638"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3814966638"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3814966638/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1595,"original_line":1595,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":102,"position":102,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815416922","pull_request_review_id":4975144234,"id":3815416922,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7jaqRa","diff_hunk":"@@ -2074,23 +2099,26 @@ Error Image::save_png(const String &p_path) const {\n \t\treturn ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\n \t}\n \n-\treturn save_png_func(p_path, Ref<Image>((Image *)this));\n+\tRef<Image> self_ref(const_cast<Image *>(this));\n+\treturn save_png_func(p_path, self_ref);","path":"core/image.cpp","commit_id":"a924a9b93d5dbf8aef606d7c050a85a131f97320","original_commit_id":"bce20944b1abf745f235171dcecc1c7f47346458","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Primarily ref counting self destruction was reported as a bug by static analysis:\r\n```\r\nImage *img = memnew(Image);\r\nimg->save_png(\"path.png\");\r\n```\r\n1) `Ref<Image> self_ref(this)` ... ref count from 0 to 1\r\n2) `save_png` completes\r\n3) `self_ref` goes out of scope, refcount hits 0, destructor calls `memdelete(this)`, deleting the object itself\r\n\r\n(Whether this happens in the wild or not, I haven't tested, I'll just try it).\r\n\r\nThere were a couple of other factors too, including older compilers being a bit brittle about the temporary lifetime of the R-value.","created_at":"2026-08-19T17:51:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:51:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815416922","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815416922"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815416922"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815416922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":2105,"original_start_line":2102,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":2106,"original_line":2103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3773979536,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":182,"position":190,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815464931","pull_request_review_id":4975204082,"id":3815464931,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7ja1_j","diff_hunk":"@@ -2074,23 +2099,26 @@ Error Image::save_png(const String &p_path) const {\n \t\treturn ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\n \t}\n \n-\treturn save_png_func(p_path, Ref<Image>((Image *)this));\n+\tRef<Image> self_ref(const_cast<Image *>(this));\n+\treturn save_png_func(p_path, self_ref);","path":"core/image.cpp","commit_id":"a924a9b93d5dbf8aef606d7c050a85a131f97320","original_commit_id":"bce20944b1abf745f235171dcecc1c7f47346458","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Aha, i see.\r\nRef count from 0 to 1 should be illegal since it is expected that the first owner references the object, but as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965 showed, this was not always the case. So theoretically it's possible this path will be hit, but only in incorrectly written code.","created_at":"2026-08-19T17:58:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:58:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815464931","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815464931"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815464931"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815464931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":2105,"original_start_line":2102,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":2106,"original_line":2103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3773979536,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":182,"position":190,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815489536","pull_request_review_id":4975235783,"id":3815489536,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7ja8AA","diff_hunk":"@@ -2074,23 +2099,26 @@ Error Image::save_png(const String &p_path) const {\n \t\treturn ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\n \t}\n \n-\treturn save_png_func(p_path, Ref<Image>((Image *)this));\n+\tRef<Image> self_ref(const_cast<Image *>(this));\n+\treturn save_png_func(p_path, self_ref);","path":"core/image.cpp","commit_id":"a924a9b93d5dbf8aef606d7c050a85a131f97320","original_commit_id":"bce20944b1abf745f235171dcecc1c7f47346458","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yup, tested, the self-deletion seems a real bug.\r\n\r\nAlthough in this particular case it doesn't help either way as far as I can see, but it shows of the perils of ref counting an object with zero ref count.\r\n\r\nPresumably as well as use after free, this could also result in a double delete (although not in this example as we never manually deleted `img`).\r\n\r\n(Perhaps this is something we should have a think about whether it could be a general problem, maybe that we can avoid at compilation time, or have a mechanism to prevent. :thinking: )\r\n\r\nI'll leave this in for now, if we later decide it isn't necessary, can remove in the follow up.","created_at":"2026-08-19T18:01:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T18:23:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815489536","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815489536"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122371#discussion_r3815489536"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122371"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815489536/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":2105,"original_start_line":2102,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":2106,"original_line":2103,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3773979536,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":182,"position":190,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3815566796","pull_request_review_id":4975340326,"id":3815566796,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7jbO3M","diff_hunk":"@@ -2074,23 +2099,26 @@ Error Image::save_png(const String &p_path) const {\n \t\treturn ERR_UNAVAILABLE;\n \t}\n \n-\treturn save_png_func(p_path, Ref<Image>((Image *)this));\n+\tRef<Image> self_ref(const_cast<Image *>(this));\n+\treturn save_png_func(p_path, self_ref);","path":"core/image.cpp","commit_id":"a924a9b93d5dbf8aef606d7c050a85a131f97320","original_commit_id":"bce20944b1abf745f235171dcecc1c7f47346458","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> (Perhaps this is something we should have a think about whether it could be a general problem, maybe that we can avoid at compilation time, or have a mechanism to prevent. 🤔 )\r\n\r\nIt is; some of the legacy https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965 showed the perils and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965 specifically fixed most of the problems (with some follow-up work still needed).\r\n\r\nPractically I'm hoping to eventually refactor `Object` to start with a refcount of 1 and the initial `Ref` overtaking it, which would make even the constructor itself safe, but it will require a bit more work to get there.","created_at":"2026-08-19T18:11:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T18:12:15Z","html_url":"https